  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="66e4a386-101e-5492-84e5-c401f1529a03" activityNameId="7bde5feb-f7bb-50bb-b735-f93c8390e695" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Precious metals from electric waste, in anode slime, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Precious metals from electric waste, in anode slime, at refinery
The multi-output-process "secondary copper refining" delivers the co-products "precious metals from electric waste, in anode slime, at refinery", "copper, secondary, from electronic and electric scrap recycling, at refinery" and "nickel, secondary, from electronic and electric scrap recycling, at refinery". The product "precious metals from electric waste, …" is an intermediary in the production of secondary gold from electric scrap and is not to be used by the LCA practitioner. The flows "copper, …" and "nickel, …" are by-products of this process that receive part of the burdens allocated. They must not be used.;
UUID: 4543c411-9d71-31fa-bdc0-19cfba9b0863
Includes the refining of the copper anode to cathode copper.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production of cathode copper by electrolytic refining.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: see Geography and Technology
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4543c411-9d71-31fa-bdc0-19cfba9b0863.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
